        "created_at": "2016-11-15T19:21:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>\n[quote=\"Phantom5613\"]\nI personally want to have that scream from the begining of Deep Purple's 'Highway Star'.\n[/quote]\n</div><div>Now that I look that up (I must admit that hard rock is not a genre I normally listen to, though I make an exception for Celtic Punk sometimes...), I do like the way you think.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n[quote=\"mwc146\"]\nThe thing I like most about PW AA's power is how much faster he seems to set up -- by the end of turn one, chances are I've either got two songs or a song and an instrument in play and I was able to get something else done (either healed, helped someone else play a card, draw a bunch, or damage). Vanilla AA had a much slower build.\n[/quote]\n</div><div>Ya, that's what I like as well, that Argent is busy belting out tunes a lot more quickly here. Nice for faster villains or villains that wipe stuff out frequently.</div>",
